# Zelos v1.0 to v1.1: changelog for judges

Generated by `scripts/build_defense_kit.py` from `results/*.json` (results produced at commit `{{git_sha}}` on {{date}}). Every v1.1 figure is read from the results files; v1.0 figures are read from `results/results.json` at git tag `v1.0-submission`.

> **v1.0 (tag `v1.0-submission`) is what was submitted and evaluated.** Its write-up (`docs/WRITEUP.md`), limitations (`docs/LIMITATIONS.md`) and numbers are frozen and were not rewritten. **v1.1 is a post-deadline build** on branch `next`, prepared for the final round. Where v1.1 contradicts v1.0, this file says so and says which number to trust.

